{"id":"steam-1205420","steam":1205420,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Birth to Death","summary":"Embark on the wonderful adventure that is life. Form meaningful connections with the people around you. Be comforted by material wealth. Experience a vast array of achievements… Unless you screw it up and die before doing anything.","about":"All the most meaningful parts of life are in your hands. Hygiene, sleeping, cleaning: All for suckers! Make fun decisions! Drive sweet cars, explore the town, hang out with people. Don’t worry about the lame stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIn this world, you make the rules. You can be whoever you want to be and form relationships with the people you like. Customize your character, your car, your home and more!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCars! Mansions! Designer clothing! It can all be yours! Just make sure you land a sweet job.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBuild relationships with people. Becomes friends… OR MORE! Maybe even have some kids.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExcept maybe in-game death. Also, don’t get too creepy with your wild fantasies. Those won’t be in it.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/library_600x900.jpg?t=1663168156","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/header.jpg?t=1663168156","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/library_hero.jpg?t=1663168156","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/header.jpg?t=1663168156","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/ss_5cbf958b8f49231fac1da31be1e1de99aa30ee2c.600x338.jpg?t=1663168156","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/ss_5cbf958b8f49231fac1da31be1e1de99aa30ee2c.jpg?t=1663168156"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205420/ss_7d03921631563522c61dade496a